<p>Fire an arrow tipped with a smoke bomb inflicting <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">77%, 85%, 90%, 95%, 100%</acronym> damage and creating a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 2</acronym> cloud of thick, disorientating smoke. Those caught within will have their vision range reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 6</acronym> for 5 turns.</p><p>The distraction caused by this effect reduces the cooldown of your Concealment by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns. If the cooldown is reduced to 0, you instantly activate Concealment regardless of whether foes are too close.</p><p>The chance for the smoke bomb to affect your targets increases with your Accuracy. This requires a bow to use.</p>